  "track.sysdesign.title": "Mobile System Design",
  "track.sysdesign.summary": "Seen from the Android app: from a brief to a plan, processes and memory, threads and locks, choosing a channel, unreliable networks, caching, paging, multiple devices and conflicts, push notifications, images and large files, startup and battery, safe releases, and a worked messaging app. Following the official Android and Firebase docs, compared with system design books.",
